  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Killing is so much easier when the next mark is busy screaming over what you did to the first guy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Assassin techniques class feature, execution as a chosen execution specialization, know at least three execution techniques</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Three times per day, whenever you execute an execution technique with a presence change of -3 or -4, you may immediately grant 1 presence to a creature adjacent to your target.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
